# Terrasymbiosis: "Do this only once each turn" (CR 603.2h): "This ability triggers only if its source's controller has not
# yet taken the indicated action that turn" - the controller now. On turn 3 Bot1 puts a +1/+1 counter on its Ornithopter
# with Snakeskin Veil and draws 1, then gives Terrasymbiosis to Bot2 with Harmless Offering. Bot2 Veils its own
# Ornithopter that same turn: Bot2 has not drawn with it, so it triggers for Bot2, who draws 1.
# Bot2's hand: 7, + 1 drawn on turn 2, - Mountain - Ornithopter, - the Veil, + 1 = 6.

